nd temperature compensation for accurate display in all conditions. Fleet management software for multi-site price updates from central office.\", \"sku\": \"BL-SG-GS01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gas-station-price-led-sign\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_gas-station-price-led-sign.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/gas-station-price-led-sign\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (7-segment LED)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"10,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level of the Gas Station Price LED Sign?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The sign has a brightness of 10,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility even in bright daylight conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the fuel price updated on the sign?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Prices are updated remotely via 4G or WiFi, allowing instantaneous changes in seconds without the need for onsite adjustments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the digit height options and how far can the sign be seen?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The sign offers 12-inch or 18-inch digit heights, designed to be visible from over 500 feet, maximizing readability for passing motorists.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the LED sign durable enough for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it features an IP65 rating making it dust-tight and water-resistant. It also operates reliably within a temperature range of -40\\u00b0C to 60\\u00b0C.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does the product include any software for managing multiple signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It includes fleet management software that allows centralized control for multi-site fuel price updates, ideal for operators managing several locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this LED sign compare with traditional manual fuel price signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike manual signs, the LED display updates instantly and remotely, reducing labor costs and human error while improving price visibility and customer trust.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty coverage is available for this LED price sign?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The product typically comes with a standard manufacturer warranty covering defects and operational issues; specific terms can be provided by Brightluxx sales team upon inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED sign display multiple fuel grades simultaneously?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the sign supports displaying between 3 to 6 different fuel grades simultaneously, making it suitable for diverse fuel offerings.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/