\"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Gas Station Price LED Sign</h1><p>Showcase fuel prices clearly with Gas Station Price LED Sign in Dubai. Brightluxx offers durable and vibrant LED price displays. Request a quote now!</p><p><strong>Remote-controlled fuel price display. Update in seconds.</strong></p><p>Digital LED fuel price sign with remote update capability. High-visibility 12&quot; or 18&quot; digit height readable from 500+ feet. Automatic brightness adjustment and temperature compensation for accurate display in all conditions. Fleet management software for multi-site price updates from central office.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the brightness level of the Gas Station Price LED Sign?</h3><p>The sign has a brightness of 10,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility even in bright daylight conditions.</p><h3>How is the fuel price updated on the sign?</h3><p>Prices are updated remotely via 4G or WiFi, allowing instantaneous changes in seconds without the need for onsite adjustments.</p><h3>What are the digit height options and how far can the sign be seen?</h3><p>The sign offers 12-inch or 18-inch digit heights, designed to be visible from over 500 feet, maximizing readability for passing motorists.</p><h3>Is the LED sign durable enough for outdoor use?</h3><p>Yes, it features an IP65 rating making it dust-tight and water-resistant. It also operates reliably within a temperature range of -40°C to 60°C.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtb